{"id":2710,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为纪念建校85周年，院工会开展参观校史馆暨校史知识竞赛活动。5月28日下午4时，马克思主义学院全体教师走进兵器陈列馆，开展沉浸式国防教育与思政实践研学活动，以实地观摩深化理论认知。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLm728M77sUz67ndmUZnm7bMzVkLl--sUN-8LRnVnzv8MzC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4nkh2MYyYU4VRL8lZoR-bLz9anmrVM878nzT7Mmr2U4AFMmvYnRGDMmTFo7UYnSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYL4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7235&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/43DF72C1C3E8829180F5E7A4E9D65FC8/672D0669/8D2E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"520\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLm728M77sUz67ndmUZnm7bMzVkLl--sUN-8LRnVnzv8MzC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4nkh2MYyYU4VRL8lZoR-bLz9anmrVM878nzT7Mmr2U4AFMmvYnRGDMmTFo7UYnSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYL4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7235&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>在兵器陈列馆内，老师们驻足于各类兵器展品前，认真聆听讲解，细致了解我国国防装备的发展历程与技术突破。一件件实物生动展现了国防科技工作者自力更生、报国强军的奋斗精神，让大家在直观感受中深化了对国防安全与家国情怀的理解。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUlW2fU4lZMzl8ndlMfMm98Lz-8UzC-iM4GsnmUinR62U4-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDoky4MYhVnRlYMz74MNQ2Lz-YoRvsMzvDMRAfn7nkLlrFn7CsLmT7nlVFUzV2LYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYL4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7235&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F6837ED525136FF12287757648ADDB1E/DF729DEA/A1F3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"520\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUlW2fU4lZMzl8ndlMfMm98Lz-8UzC-iM4GsnmUinR62U4-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDoky4MYhVnRlYMz74MNQ2Lz-YoRvsMzvDMRAfn7nkLlrFn7CsLmT7nlVFUzV2LYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYL4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7235&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>随后，全体教师走进校史馆，循着历史脉络重温学校办学征程。大家仔细观看史料图片、文献实物与成果展示，感悟一代代教育工作者薪火相传的责任与担当。校史中蕴含的奋斗精神与使命情怀，让在场教师深受触动。</p><p></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLm728M77sUz67ndmUZnm7bMzVkLl--sUN-8LRnVnzv8MzC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4nkh2MYyYU4VRL8lZoR-bLz9anmrVM878nzT7Mmr2U4AFMmvYnRGDMmTFo7UYnSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYL4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7235&e=.jpeg"}